source_raw_tex:
\eqalign{F_{\gamma K}
&=\{x:x\restr K=x_{\gamma}\restr K\}
=\{x:x\restr K_n=x_{\gamma}\restr K_n\text{ for every }n\in\Bbb N\}\cr
&=\bigcap_{n\in\Bbb N}F_{\gamma,K_n}
\subseteq\bigcap_{n\in\Bbb N}X\setminus E_n
=X\setminus E,\cr}

